      <headword id="idm2959800">clàtair</headword>
      <description>like a ‘gràpa’ except that it is designed to pull rather than lift. Prongs are therefore rounded. Used for pulling seaweed. <illustration src="TigharryCandJMacDonaldmiscillust1.jpg" width="250"/> </description>
    </item>
