    <item>
      <headword id="idm3002352">[cruach]</headword>
      <description>Cha do laoisg thu seachd cruachan móra fhathast comhla ris. Refers to a future wife not having lived with her husband to be.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idm3035832">[spàinn]</headword>
      <description>Mur a dean mi spàinnean millidh mi adhaircean. Refers to the practice of spoon-making.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idm2925744">[treinidh]</headword>
      <description>Cha deanar treinidh gun triuir ’s tha i cùbach gun cheathrair. Refers to the numbers required in courting.</description>
    </item>
